description:
the demolition of the buildings at greendene farm other than greendene farmhouse and the development of a 65-bedroom elderly care home use class c2 with access, car-parking and a comprehensive landscaping strategy.
as amended / clarified by:
+ ecology survey submitted 3 april 2018;
+ drainage details submitted 26 april 2018, 16 october 2018 and 10 december 2018;
+ updated plans and whole estate enhancement plan submitted 7 november 2018;
+ alternative site assessment submitted 15 february 2019;
+ updated whole estates enhancement plan submitted 9 april 2019;
+ final planning balance letter and addendum on need submitted 8 may 2019;
+ additional landscape information submitted 29 july 2019; and
+ legal opinion submitted 22 august 2019.
